VERDICT: The green log is a null result, not evidence — the gate is fed designs mechanically derived from the table it parses, and the rules that would make a design real (a mandatory stop on every building node, five things with contents, a sabotage, a baseline) are optional (design_gate.py:150) or absent, so 0 findings measures the emitter, not the designs.
